Only thing is 1) I got a dirty spoon with my Crème brûlée and 2) there was a dead bug on the inside panel of the glass. Other than that, everything was great. Fast service, clean bathroom. 

Really want to try the regular menu too, the Mother's Day menu was obviously tailored so it would be nice to see all their options. Great prices!!"}

