The food was pretty good like it usually is, but the service I received was very poor. Consistently throughout our meal I had to flag down the waiter for things that should have been provided without asking (napkins and silverware, drink refills, ordering more food). I would have understood his neglect if the restaurant was packed and he was waiting on multiple tables, but the restaurant was not the slightest bit busy since it was 8 pm on a Monday night and we were his only table. 

Because this was my first time receiving bad service from  here I was going to just ignore it and still return to dine here because of the good desserts and drinks."}

